<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I will tell the wondrous story,</l><l>How my lost estate to save,</l><l>In His boundless love and mercy,</l><l>He the ransom freely gave.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I will praise my dear Redeemer,</l><l>His triumphant pow’r I’ll tell,</l><l>How the victory He giveth</l><l>Over sin, and death, and hell.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I will sing of my Redeemer,</l><l>And His heav’nly love to me;</l><l>He from death to life hath brought me,</l><l>Son of God with Him to be.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
